.270" end="00:45.810">I'm </span><span begin="00:45.810" end="00:47.010">claustrophobic </span><span begin="00:47.010" end="00:47.730">closing </span><span begin="00:47.730" end="00:47.850">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.850" end="00:50.640"><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:48.780">And </span><span begin="00:48.780" end="00:49.710">I'm </span><span begin="00:49.710" end="00:50.640">catastrophic</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.640" end="00:54.870"><span begin="00:50.640" end="00:51.000">Not </span><span begin="00:51.000" end="00:51.480">againI'm </span><span begin="00:51.480" end="00:52.080">smeared </span><span begin="00:52.080" end="00:52.650">across </span><span begin="00:52.650" end="00:52.770">the </span><span begin="00:52.770" end="00:53.490">page </span><span begin="00:53.490" end="00:53.760">and </span><span begin="00:53.760" end="00:54.000">doused </span><span begin="00:54.000" end="00:54.060">in </span><span begin="00:54.060" end="00:54.870">gasoline</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.870" end="00:56.940"><span begin="00:54.870" end="00:54.960">I </span><span begin="00:54.960" end="00:55.470">wear </span><span begin="00:55.470" end="00:55.620">you </span><span begin="00:55.620" end="00:56.190">like </span><span begin="00:56.190" end="00:56.250">a </span><span begin="00:56.250" end="00:56.940">stain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.970" end="00:58.890"><span begin="00:56.970" end="00:57.330">Yet </span><span begin="00:57.330" end="00:57.480">I'm </span><span begin="00:57.480" end="00:57.600">the </span><span begin="00:57.600" end="00:57.960">one </span><span begin="00:57.960" end="00:58.170">who's </span><span begin="00:58.170" end="00:58.890">obscene</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.920" end="01:02.190"><span begin="00:58.920" end="00:59.220">Catch </span><span begin="00:59.220" end="00:59.400">me </span><span begin="00:59.400" end="00:59.700">up </span><span begin="00:59.700" end="00:59.910">on </span><span begin=